# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local` for Next.js auto-load) and fill in your values.
# `.env` and `.env*.local` are gitignored.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required for production — SEO (canonical URLs, Open Graph / Twitter absolutes)
# Optional locally: defaults to http://localhost:8080 in src/lib/seo-config.ts
# (matches `npm run serve` static preview). Drives @tetherto/docs-seo-*
# (metadata, sitemap, robots, JSON-LD).
#
# `NEXT_PUBLIC_DOCS_ORIGIN` is preferred. `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` is accepted
# as a fallback for environments that already set the more generic name.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_DOCS_ORIGIN=https://docs.pears.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://docs.pears.com

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional — SEO (@tetherto/docs-seo-*)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Absolute HTTPS logo for JSON-LD `Organization` publisher.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DOCS_PUBLISHER_LOGO_URL=https://your-cdn.example/logo.png

# Skip Takumi OG prebuild; metadata uses staticOgImagePath / public/og-default.png.
# SKIP_OG_BUILD=1

# Prebuild only (tsx scripts/generate-og.tsx — not loaded from .env.local
# unless exported into the shell or set in CI).
# DOCS_OG_SITE_LABEL=Pear
# DOCS_OG_CONCURRENCY=3

# Set in `npm run build` / `dev` already. Silences only the [@tetherto/docs-seo]
# warnings for fields with sensible auto-generated / inferred defaults
# (ogImage from Takumi prebuild, schemaType inferred from docType, lastModified
# injected by fumadocs-mdx). Keeps `description` and `docType` warnings live.
# DOCS_SEO_QUIET_GENERATED=1

# Heavy hammer: silence ALL [@tetherto/docs-seo] warnings, including the
# required-`description` warning. Use sparingly.
# DOCS_SEO_SILENT=1
